      "writtenOn": "2015-04-08T18:32:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we converting to a utf8 string here? This is unnecessary. If this is the price to pay for the use of std::stringstream then I don\u0027t think it\u0027s worth it.",
      "revId": "6950ef6fda6e9de5588ef6d93fcb2bd9174034e7",
